        "body": "Theme is light, system or dark through `html[data-theme]`; with no attribute the OS preference applies, and an inline boot script restores a saved choice before first paint.",
        "section": "components"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Inline Error Rule",
        "body": "Mutations opt into a success toast through `meta.toast`; errors stay inline next to the control that failed.",
